  "observed": "At 200% text on a 480x360 native output, the current Restore/Minimize/Maximize menu overflows; End/Home and arrows reveal enabled operation endpoints and skip disabled Restore, Tab reveals Close and returns to the selected operation, Escape returns group focus, and current operation labels paint in actual compositor pixels. Ten-member picker selection still produces one exact activation and real GTK input. Default-size running-pin secondary/Menu/Shift-F10, minimize/restore, typing and Task View dismissal regression passed.",
  "scope": "Native current three-operation menu overflow and physical keyboard/operation labels; compiled 20-operation projection, growth, viewport, manual-scroll, Close-publication and inactive-document checks. Additional native providers/actions are outside this fixture; original AT and independent acceptance remain open. Active native popup reflow remains unqualified.",
